  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IR-6.4. Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) IN EMERGENCY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective leadership is established for Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) cluster coordination for emergency preparedness and response  children and women
affected by emergency have access to sufficient number of toilets and hand washing facilities and children receive critical WASH-
related information and have access to safe Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) facilities their learning environment and in child-friendly spaces in line with
the CCCs.</narrative>
  </description>
